  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngilaleleni nina ziqhingi; lalelani nina zizwe ezikude. UJehova wangibiza kwasesiswini; ezibilinini zikamama wabiza igama lami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawenza umlomo wami waba njengenkemba ebukhali; ethunzini lesandla sakhe wangithukusa, wangenza isiqu esiphucuziweyo; wangithukusa emgodleni wakhe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi kimi: Uyinceku yami, Israyeli, engizodunyiswa ngayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngase ngithi: “Ngishiyile, ngichithe amandla ami, ngazikhandla ngeze; nokho ilungelo lami likuJehova, nomsebenzi wami ukuNkulunkulu wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manje, usho uJehova, owangibumba kwasesiswini ukuba ngibe yinceku yakhe, ukuze ngibuyisele uJakobe kuye: Noma u-Israyeli engaqoqwa, nokho ngiyoba yinkazimulo emehlweni kaJehova, futhi uNkulunkulu wami uyakuba amandla ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Kuyinto elula ukuba ube yinceku yami ukuvusa izizwe zakwaJakobe nokubuyisela abalindi bakwa-Israyeli; ngizakukunika ube ngukukhanya kwabezizwe, ukuze ube yinsindiso yami. Ekupheleni komhlaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usho kanje uJehova, uMhlengi ka-Israyeli, noNgcwele wakhe, kuye odelela umuntu, kuye isizwe esimenyanyayo, encekwini yezikhulu: Amakhosi ayakubona lokhu, asukume, nezikhulu zikhuleke ngenxa yalokho. KaJehova othembekileyo noNgcwele ka-Israyeli, uyakunikhetha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usho kanje uJehova, uthi: “Ngesikhathi sokuthokoza ngakuzwa, nangosuku lwensindiso ngakusiza; amafa alahliwe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuze uthi kuzo izibotshwa: Phumani; kwabasebumnyameni zibonakaliseni. Bayoklaba emigwaqweni emikhulu, namadlelo abo ayoba phezu kwazo zonke izindawo eziphakemeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayikulamba, noma bome; futhi ukushisa nelanga ngeke kubashaye; ngokuba lowo onomusa kubo uyakubahola, abahole ngasemithonjeni yamanzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakwenza zonke izintaba zami zibe umgwaqo, nezindlela zami ezinkulu ziphakame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, bayakuza bevela kude, bheka, bavela enyakatho nasentshonalanga; nokuthi kuvela ezweni laseSinimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hlabelelani nina mazulu! futhi jabula, O mhlaba! niqhume ngokujabula, zintaba; ngokuba uJehova wabaduduza abantu bakhe, waba nomusa kwabampofu bakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa iZiyoni yathi: INkosi ingitshiyile, leNkosi yami ingikhohliwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazane angamkhohlwa yini umntanakhe osancela, angayihawukeli indodana yesizalo sakhe? yebo, bangakhohlwa, kepha mina angiyikukukhohlwa wena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, ngikubhalile ezintendeni zezandla zami; izingange zakho ziphambi kwami njalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana bakho bayakushesha; abachithi bakho nabakuchithayo bayakuphuma kuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
