          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanicindezelayo ngiyakudlisa eyabo inyama; futhi bayodakwa yigazi labo siqu ngokungathi kungewayini elimnandi, futhi yonke inyama iyokwazi ukuthi mina, Jehova, nginguMhlengi wakho kanye noMhlengi wakho, uMninimandla kaJakobe.",
          "type": "text",
